<title>FRANCE: Havas unit acquires 50 pct of Telelistas.</title>
<headline>Havas unit acquires 50 pct of Telelistas.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Havas Media Communication subsidiary Oda said on Thursday that it had acquired 50 percent of the Brazilian company Telelistas, which publishes the White and Yellow Pages in Rio de Janeiro.</p>
<p>Oda also said it was creating a telephone listings unit in Lebanon that would be 80 percent held by Oda and 20 percent by Lebanese partners to pursue a five-year listings contract.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Telelistas generates 130 million francs of annual sales, but gave no financial details on the deal.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
